abstract: >-
  An architecture blueprint for treating test data as a governed Quality
  Engineering capability across UI, API, integration, performance and AI
  workflows. The work covers deterministic synthetic generation, privacy
  classification, masking and replacement, referential integrity, business-rule
  validation, parallel-safe isolation, lifecycle and cleanup, provenance,
  performance data, AI/RAG evaluation datasets, production-to-regression data,
  bounded agentic generation, CI/CD quality gates and enterprise adoption.